Before, the entry point did not exist. After:
```ts
type Product = { name: string };
function respond(body: unknown, catalog: Map<string, Product>): string {
  if (body === null || typeof body !== 'object' || !('id' in body) ||
      typeof body.id !== 'string' || body.id === '') {
    throw new Error('invalid request');
  }
  const product = catalog.get(body.id);
